# Allow-list build context (Phase 9.1). Everything is excluded by default and
# only what the backend image needs is re-admitted, so a forgotten pattern can
# never leak a secret (.env*), local notes (BUILD-PLAN.md, HANDOFF.md) or the
# frontend / docs / .git trees into the context that `az acr build` uploads.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!backend/
# Within backend/: tests, caches and any local settings overlay stay out. The
# image is configured by environment variables only, exactly like Render.
backend/tests/
backend/**/__pycache__/
backend/settings.yaml
